title: Day7_Zeus_Intro
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>

//DOOR JINGLE

Hephaestus: Aelius.

-> Hephaestus. (deference)
-> H-dog! Good to see you! (humor)
    Hephaestus: ...
    Hephaestus: Do not call me that.
    Aelius: [Positive] Understood!
-> There you are! (aggressive)

Aelius: [Positive] What would you like?
// door JINGLE
<<Hide Hephaestus>>
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
Zeus: HEPHAESTUS! <i>HEPHAESTUS!!!!!</i>
<<Hide Zeus>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
Hephaestus: Oh no.
<<Hide Hephaestus>>
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
Zeus: HEPHAESTUS, MY BOY!
Aelius: Hello, King Zeus.

-> High relationship
    Zeus: AELIUS! HAHA! LOOK, IT'S MY BOY!
-> Medium relationship
    Zeus: CHILD! HAHA! LOOK, IT’S MY BOY!
-> Low relationship
    Zeus: CHILD! THIS IS MY BOY!

-> Is that so? (deference)
    <<Hide Zeus>>
    <<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
    Hephaestus: I-
    <<Hide Hephaestus>>
    <<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
    Zeus: YES! DON’T YOU KNOW? HEPHAESTUS IS MY CHILD!
    <<Hide Zeus>>
-> Who? (humor)
    Zeus: HEPHAESTUS! MY SON! HE’S RIGHT HERE!
-> Yeah, we've met. (aggressive)
    Zeus: Oh? GOOD! YES!

<<Hide Zeus>>
<<Hide Aelius>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "left" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
Hephaestus: Father, I-
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
Zeus: YES! HEPHAESTUS!
Hephaestus: I just-
Zeus: MY BOY! WHAT IS IT?
Hephaestus: I-
Zeus: AELIUS! HAVE YOU TAKEN MY SON’S ORDER YET?
<<Hide Hephaestus>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
Aelius: Uh, no-
Zeus: WELL? WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?
Aelius: What can I get you, Hephaestus?
<<Hide Zeus>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
Hephaestus: ...
Hephaestus: The <b>Helios Steak,</b> if you would.
Aelius: Right away.

// HELIOS STEAK
<<StartCooking MakenaTestScene4>>
<<HideAll>>
