title: Day7_Zeus_ReturnFancy
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>

Aelius: Your food.
<<Hide Hephaestus>>
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
Zeus: ...
<<Hide Zeus>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
Hephaestus: Thank you, Aelius.

-> Is everything okay? (deference)
    <<Hide Hephaestus>>
    <<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
    Zeus: ...
    <<Hide Zeus>>
    <<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
    Hephaestus: It's alright, Aelius.
    <<Hide Hephaestus>>
-> Geez, who killed the mood? (humor)
    <<Hide Hephaestus>>
    <<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
    Zeus: After all this time, you still treat our affairs with such frivolity, <i>child.</i>
    <<Hide Zeus>>
    <<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "right" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
    Hephaestus: Father, it's not their fault-
    <<Hide Hephaestus>>
-> I'm gonna go. (aggressive)

<<Hide Aelius>>
<<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "left" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
Zeus: UNATTENTIVE?
Zeus: I WAS <i>UNATTENTIVE?</i>
Hephaestus: Father-
Zeus: I AM THE KING OF THE GODS, HEPHAESTUS.
Zeus: I <i>APOLOGIZE</i> IF I COULD NOT MAKE TIME FOR ARTS AND CRAFTS.
Zeus: I HAD <i>MORE IMPORTANT</i> THINGS TO DO!
Hephaestus: Yes. You did.
Zeus: ...
Hephaestus: Hrmph.
<<Hide Zeus>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "right" "bottom" #674ea7>>
Aelius: Um...
Aelius: How's... the food?
Hephaestus: ...


    Hephaestus: It's... subtle.
    <<Hide Aelius>>
    <<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
    Zeus: You know… I remember when you were but an infant.
    Hephaestus: …What?
    Zeus: After your mother failed to hide you away-
    Hephaestus: You both got into a fight and threw me from the top of Olympus.
    Zeus: Yes, well. She can be difficult, your mother.
    Zeus: What I mean to say is, even though she didn’t want me to find out about you, I did.
    Zeus: I only regret not realizing your brilliance back then.
    -> *Stay silent* (deference)
        Hephaestus: Is it her fault you never visited my forge?
        Zeus: ...
        Zeus: No.
        Zeus: No, she is not to blame.
    -> Now hug each other. (humor)
        Zeus: <i>Child.</i>
        Hephaestus: <i>Aelius.</i>
        <<Hide Hephaestus>>
        <<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
        Aelius: Sorry.
        <<Hide Aelius>>
    -> She didn’t make you ignore him for most of his life.
        Zeus: ...
        Zeus: No, she didn't.
        Zeus: That fault falls with me.
    
    <<HideAll>>
    <<Act "Hephaestus" "Hephaestus" "left" "bottom" #FF8C00>>
    Hephaestus: Father, I appreciate your words.
    Hephaestus: Maybe, with time, I could see you being a part of my life.
    Hephaestus: But for now...
    Hephaestus: Hrm.

<<HideAll>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
Zeus: … Did I do something wrong, Aelius?
-> He needs time. (deference)
    Zeus: You think so?
    Aelius: I do.
    Zeus: Thank you, Aelius. I’m sure the food was impeccable.
-> No such thing as wrong. (humor)
    Zeus: ... What?
    Aelius: Y’know. In the grand scheme of things.
    Zeus: What are you talking about?
    Aelius: We're all just stardust.
    Zeus: Stop spouting nonsense.
-> Yes. (aggressive)
    Zeus: ...
    Zeus: I see.

<<HideAll>>
<<jump Day7_Aphrodite_Intro>>
    

